      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Clients are not an issue anymore. It's not that they don't exist, it's quite the opposite; most users use a client. However, most clients do not implement or support the use of hacks in order to prevent their takedown. Most of the hacks you see are actually avatar driven.\nI should also mention that I have never encountered a client capable of crashing someone (this doesn't mean they don't exist, however..)\nCrashing is an avatar exploit.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
