      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ik client users but they use them to fix issues (i.e ui bugg not slecting people, accidental chair sitting/portsl entering, alt-f4 taking 12 years to work right, limit polys on avatars, etc) yes thaere are malicous ones out there and those should be bannable. But some have fixed the game faster than the devs do which have been around 2-3 years.\nThe real problem is if people dont like mod users. The devs should actuslly put work into fixing the game so we dont have to",
